1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,636
31 days.

2
00:00:01,856 --> 00:00:05,696
That is how long is left until GTA 6 is scheduled to launch.

3
00:00:05,916 --> 00:00:09,164
And this week, Rockstar released the final launch trailer.

4
00:00:09,384 --> 00:00:12,903
In this video, I will walk you through what is confirmed,

5
00:00:12,903 --> 00:00:16,792
what is still rumor, and exactly what to do before November 19.

6
00:00:18,092 --> 00:00:21,580
Today is October 19. Launch day is November 19.

7
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:25,064
That is 31 days, which is four weeks and three days.

8
00:00:25,284 --> 00:00:27,284
So let us make every one of them count.

9
00:00:28,584 --> 00:00:31,272
First, the news driving today's conversation.

10
00:00:31,492 --> 00:00:36,724
On October 15, Rockstar Games released the launch trailer for GTA 6.

11
00:00:38,024 --> 00:00:40,360
Here is what is confirmed from that release.

12
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:43,348
The date is November 19, 2026.

13
00:00:43,568 --> 00:00:47,728
The launch platforms are PS5 and Xbox Series X|S.

14
00:00:47,948 --> 00:00:54,540
And Rockstar says all of the trailer footage was captured on a standard PS5, not a PS5 Pro.

15
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:59,056
The trailer leans into its two leads, Jason and Lucia.

16
00:00:59,276 --> 00:01:03,260
Press coverage says Jason has a military past and is struggling to find work.

17
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:07,496
Lucia calls him from jail, and the two reconnect before their criminal adventure.

18
00:01:07,716 --> 00:01:11,033
Some outlets call the tone more intimate than earlier trailers,

19
00:01:11,033 --> 00:01:13,876
but that is interpretation, not an official statement.

20
00:01:15,176 --> 00:01:17,512
The story is set in the state of Leonida.

21
00:01:17,732 --> 00:01:20,627
Rockstar's description says an easy score goes wrong,

22
00:01:20,627 --> 00:01:23,412
and a criminal conspiracy spreads across the state.

23
00:01:23,632 --> 00:01:27,712
Its tagline promises the darkest side of the sunniest place in America.

24
00:01:29,012 --> 00:01:31,510
The trailer also packs in big set pieces,

25
00:01:31,510 --> 00:01:35,044
from helicopter chaos to a rooftop jump into a hotel pool.

26
00:01:35,264 --> 00:01:38,778
One report mentions a sweat system tied to how hard characters dance,

27
00:01:38,778 --> 00:01:41,680
though it is unclear whether that appears in the trailer.

28
00:01:42,980 --> 00:01:47,498
Music fans should note the debut of a new song, Flower in a Hurricane,

29
00:01:47,498 --> 00:01:52,596
by Justice, featuring Tame Impala, SZA, and King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard.

30
00:01:52,816 --> 00:01:56,032
Coverage says it will be on the official soundtrack album.

31
00:01:56,252 --> 00:02:00,479
And reports say the trailer passed one million YouTube views in about half an hour,

32
00:02:00,479 --> 00:02:02,668
though early view counts can be unreliable.

33
00:02:03,968 --> 00:02:08,000
To understand why this launch feels so big, look at the road that led here.

34
00:02:08,220 --> 00:02:11,100
This game has been in development for more than a decade.

35
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:17,312
Rockstar revealed the first trailer in December 2023, aiming for 2025.

36
00:02:17,532 --> 00:02:21,948
In May 2025, the date moved to May 26, 2026.

37
00:02:22,168 --> 00:02:29,144
Then on November 6, 2025, Take-Two announced another delay, this time to November 19, 2026.

38
00:02:29,364 --> 00:02:35,044
On May 21, 2026, Take-Two's CEO confirmed that date again on an earnings call.

39
00:02:35,264 --> 00:02:39,536
And on October 15, 2026, the launch trailer arrived.

40
00:02:40,836 --> 00:02:44,100
The second delay pushed the game back by roughly six months.

41
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:48,731
Rockstar said the extra time would let the team finish the game to its usual standard,

42
00:02:48,731 --> 00:02:50,320
and it apologized for the wait.

43
00:02:50,540 --> 00:02:55,162
At the time, Take-Two's shares fell by nearly 30 dollars in after-hours trading,

44
00:02:55,162 --> 00:02:56,028
then rebounded.

45
00:02:57,328 --> 00:03:01,579
Why do huge games slip? Rockstar has only said it needs more time to polish,

46
00:03:01,579 --> 00:03:04,208
but we can look at why this happens in general.

47
00:03:04,428 --> 00:03:08,592
Open-world games have enormous amounts of content that must all work together,

48
00:03:08,592 --> 00:03:10,780
so late-stage bug fixing can take months.

49
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,274
Performance tuning is another big piece,

50
00:03:13,274 --> 00:03:16,856
especially making sure the game runs smoothly on base consoles.

51
00:03:17,076 --> 00:03:21,652
And console makers require final testing and certification before any game can ship.

52
00:03:21,872 --> 00:03:27,600
None of this is a claim about the specifics of GTA 6. It is general industry context.

53
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:31,204
Since then, the messaging has been consistent.

54
00:03:31,424 --> 00:03:33,977
In May, Take-Two's CEO, Strauss Zelnick,

55
00:03:33,977 --> 00:03:37,360
said the company feels really good about November 19.

56
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:40,806
He also said that Take-Two will still market the game heavily,

57
00:03:40,806 --> 00:03:44,396
though with less reliance on network television ads than in the past.

58
00:03:44,616 --> 00:03:45,399
And as of May,

59
00:03:45,399 --> 00:03:48,308
the price and a third trailer had not been revealed.

60
00:03:48,308 --> 00:03:51,160
The price has since appeared in pre-order listings.

61
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:54,700
So what do we actually know for sure?

62
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:57,976
Let us separate confirmed facts from open questions.

63
00:03:59,276 --> 00:04:03,356
Confirmed: the release date is November 19, 2026.

64
00:04:03,576 --> 00:04:08,728
Confirmed: the launch platforms are PS5 and Xbox Series X|S.

65
00:04:08,948 --> 00:04:12,181
And according to a report from the September shareholder meeting,

66
00:04:12,181 --> 00:04:14,916
the game ships as a single-player experience at launch.

67
00:04:16,216 --> 00:04:17,752
Now the open questions.

68
00:04:17,972 --> 00:04:20,372
There is no announced date for a PC version.

69
00:04:20,592 --> 00:04:23,520
Rockstar has not announced a schedule for an online mode.

70
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:26,218
There are no signs of a Switch 2 version,

71
00:04:26,218 --> 00:04:30,508
and no known plans for subscription services like Game Pass or PS Plus.

72
00:04:30,728 --> 00:04:33,368
Any specific date you see for these is a guess.

73
00:04:34,668 --> 00:04:38,924
One more detail I could not confirm is the exact launch time in your region.

74
00:04:39,144 --> 00:04:44,344
Release times can differ by platform and country, so check your store page closer to launch.

75
00:04:45,644 --> 00:04:46,988
Next, the money.

76
00:04:47,208 --> 00:04:50,952
Console pre-orders opened on June 25, 2026.

77
00:04:52,252 --> 00:04:56,972
In the US, the Standard Edition is listed at $79.99.

78
00:04:57,192 --> 00:05:01,128
The Ultimate Edition is listed at $99.99.

79
00:05:01,348 --> 00:05:05,011
That is exactly $20 more, for exclusive vehicles, weapons,

80
00:05:05,011 --> 00:05:08,420
apparel, and missions, according to the store listing.

81
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,192
Prices vary by region.

82
00:05:11,412 --> 00:05:16,530
The Standard Edition is listed at £69.99 in the UK,

83
00:05:16,530 --> 00:05:21,045
€79.99 in Europe, and AU$129.95 in Australia.

84
00:05:21,265 --> 00:05:23,809
Always check your own store before you buy.

85
00:05:25,109 --> 00:05:27,173
Pre-order extras are worth knowing about.

86
00:05:27,393 --> 00:05:32,193
Retailers list a Vintage Vice City Pack for orders placed before November 20.

87
00:05:32,413 --> 00:05:36,061
Digital pre-orders also list a free month of GTA+.

88
00:05:36,281 --> 00:05:41,369
These details come from store and press listings, so confirm them on the page where you buy.

89
00:05:42,669 --> 00:05:45,106
Digital or physical? One report says physical

90
00:05:45,106 --> 00:05:47,869
editions contain a download code instead of a disc.

91
00:05:48,089 --> 00:05:52,425
Treat that as a single-source detail, and check the box description before you buy.

92
00:05:52,645 --> 00:05:57,493
Digital pre-orders can be pre-loaded, so you can be ready the moment launch day arrives.

93
00:05:58,793 --> 00:06:02,633
One warning: fake pre-order listings have circulated online.

94
00:06:02,853 --> 00:06:05,749
Stick to official console stores and trusted retailers,

95
00:06:05,749 --> 00:06:08,645
and be wary of any deal that looks too good to be true.

96
00:06:09,945 --> 00:06:12,345
Now let us put the key dates on your calendar.

97
00:06:13,645 --> 00:06:15,261
Today is October 19.

98
00:06:15,481 --> 00:06:19,912
On November 9, Take-Two reports quarterly earnings at 4:30 p.m. Eastern,

99
00:06:19,912 --> 00:06:22,313
the last investor update before launch.

100
00:06:22,533 --> 00:06:27,685
On November 12, digital pre-loads begin, and physical editions are reported to arrive.

101
00:06:27,905 --> 00:06:31,441
And on November 19, GTA 6 launches.

102
00:06:32,741 --> 00:06:34,645
A quick note on that earnings call.

103
00:06:34,865 --> 00:06:39,617
The quarter it covers ended September 30, so it will not include any launch sales.

104
00:06:39,837 --> 00:06:44,973
Real sales figures should show up in the next report, expected in early 2027.

105
00:06:45,193 --> 00:06:49,273
So the November 9 call is more about updates and tone than sales numbers.

106
00:06:50,573 --> 00:06:51,677
Pre-loading matters.

107
00:06:51,897 --> 00:06:54,495
It means the game files download before launch,

108
00:06:54,495 --> 00:06:57,369
so on November 19 you press play instead of waiting.

109
00:06:57,589 --> 00:07:01,669
Pre-loads are reported to begin on November 12, one week early.

110
00:07:01,889 --> 00:07:06,785
Check your free storage now, because a modern open-world game can need a large download.

111
00:07:08,085 --> 00:07:10,549
Rumors spread fast around a launch this big.

112
00:07:11,849 --> 00:07:14,009
Here is a real example from this year.

113
00:07:14,229 --> 00:07:16,258
In the week before the May earnings call,

114
00:07:16,258 --> 00:07:20,565
a retailer page appeared to leak a pre-order date, but that turned out to be a mistake.

115
00:07:20,785 --> 00:07:26,433
An anonymous forum post then claimed a delay to February 2027, which had no credibility.

116
00:07:26,653 --> 00:07:29,837
Then the CEO confirmed November 19 on the call.

117
00:07:31,137 --> 00:07:35,089
Here is a simple three-step filter for any GTA 6 headline.

118
00:07:35,309 --> 00:07:39,949
One: does it come from Rockstar, Take-Two, or an official store page?

119
00:07:40,169 --> 00:07:43,401
Two: does the claim name a source, a date, and a number?

120
00:07:43,621 --> 00:07:47,749
Three: does the outlet say confirmed, or does it say reportedly?

121
00:07:47,969 --> 00:07:51,361
If a claim fails these tests, treat it as a rumor and wait.

122
00:07:52,661 --> 00:07:53,941
Now, how to get ready.

123
00:07:55,241 --> 00:07:57,193
Here is your launch-week checklist.

124
00:07:57,413 --> 00:08:00,421
Free up console storage so pre-load is never blocked.

125
00:08:00,641 --> 00:08:04,465
Update your console and check your internet connection before November 12.

126
00:08:04,685 --> 00:08:08,861
Decide on a budget, and whether the Ultimate Edition extras matter to you.

127
00:08:09,081 --> 00:08:12,249
Buy only from official stores and trusted retailers.

128
00:08:12,469 --> 00:08:16,677
And protect yourself from spoilers, because leaks spread fast around launch.

129
00:08:17,977 --> 00:08:19,753
Not sure which edition to pick?

130
00:08:19,973 --> 00:08:23,893
If you mainly want the game, the Standard Edition is the base purchase.

131
00:08:24,113 --> 00:08:27,278
If you want the extra vehicles, weapons, apparel,

132
00:08:27,278 --> 00:08:31,025
and missions, the Ultimate Edition adds them for $20 more.

133
00:08:31,245 --> 00:08:34,493
Either way, there is no need to rush into a decision this week.

134
00:08:35,793 --> 00:08:38,129
Should you buy at launch or wait for reviews?

135
00:08:38,349 --> 00:08:41,198
It is a personal call. Many players buy on day one,

136
00:08:41,198 --> 00:08:44,829
while others prefer to see reviews and performance reports first.

137
00:08:45,049 --> 00:08:48,969
I have not seen an official review date announced, so watch for official word.

138
00:08:50,269 --> 00:08:52,781
What should you watch over the next 31 days?

139
00:08:54,081 --> 00:08:55,521
Watch these three things.

140
00:08:55,741 --> 00:08:58,365
November 9: Take-Two's earnings call.

141
00:08:58,585 --> 00:09:00,745
November 12: the pre-load start.

142
00:09:00,965 --> 00:09:03,823
And any official word from Rockstar on launch-day details,

143
00:09:03,823 --> 00:09:06,533
which is the only place to trust for new announcements.

144
00:09:07,833 --> 00:09:08,633
Quick recap.

145
00:09:08,853 --> 00:09:15,845
GTA 6 launches November 19, 2026 on PS5 and Xbox Series X|S.

146
00:09:16,065 --> 00:09:18,849
The launch trailer arrived October 15.

147
00:09:19,069 --> 00:09:24,365
Pre-orders are open, with a US Standard price of $79.99.

148
00:09:24,585 --> 00:09:26,985
PC and online have no announced dates.

149
00:09:27,205 --> 00:09:30,117
And pre-load starts November 12, reportedly.

150
00:09:31,417 --> 00:09:33,145
That is your 31-day briefing.

151
00:09:33,365 --> 00:09:36,012
If it helped, follow for the next daily explainer,

152
00:09:36,012 --> 00:09:39,189
and tell me in the comments what you are most excited about.

153
00:09:39,409 --> 00:09:42,577
Details can change, so always check official sources.

154
00:09:42,797 --> 00:09:45,200
This video is an independent explainer and is

155
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:47,709
not affiliated with Rockstar Games or Take-Two.

